  vendorName: Caterer Calvin
  offerText: My kitchen prepared too many gourmet meat platters. Pay a fraction of
    the cost, clear some table space, and enjoy a meal fit for a king.
  acceptResultText: You make room and take a bite. The meat is completely raw in
    the middle. You spend the rest of the hour terribly sick.
  rejectResultText: You turn him away. As the smell of the food lingers in the hall,
    your stomach growls painfully.
